{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">野村：药明康德业务与季度数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">8月3日盘后，药明康德公布1H26业绩。营收与净利润分别同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">39%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">34%</span>，达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">289亿元</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">111亿元</span>，明显高于NOM此前预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">253亿元</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">95亿元</span>，也高于彭博一致预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">249亿元</span>和95亿元。这份成绩单的主要拉动来自化学业务板块，其中D&amp;M业务同比增长67%至81亿元，TIDES业务同比增长75%至49亿元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层同步大幅上调全年指引。持续经营业务收入增速从原先的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">39%</span>，对应收入区间<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">585亿元</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">605亿元</span>。NOM据此将FY26F收入与盈利预测分别上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11.3%</span>和15.2%。截至8月3日收盘，公司报价报128.50元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWz1Zd1K0ZCjDvYMOxRE2bgj5tk50Z5RpU1icCU0X2UYRYauibbxibVWTBLiaWnSt862ibHhBAQ8icHdANC83TtuKNyeicfQRjUTxiaAZk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1.业务与季度数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">2Q26收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">165亿元</span>，其中化学业务贡献<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">144亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">61%</span>。更值得关注的是毛利率表现：<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>毛利率达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">55.7%</span>，同比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>10.1个百分点。这一扩张幅度在CXO行业中并不常见，它意味着收入增长并非单纯依靠产能扩张驱动，而是伴随着运营效率的同步提升。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">利润端，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>净利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">32%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">64亿元</span>。管理层披露的调整后非IFRS净利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">92%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">69.7亿元</span>。两者之间的差异主要来自其他收益减少（<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>仅<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.63亿元</span>，去年同期约21亿元）以及税项支出增加至15亿元。毛利率扩张在很大程度上抵消了这两项不利因素。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">编辑评论</span>：</strong> 毛利率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>10.1个百分点是这份业绩里最值得细看的数字。它说明D&amp;M和TIDES业务的高增长带有规模效应，而不是靠低价换量。后续季度如果毛利率能维持在这个水平附近，市场对盈利质量的讨论会少很多。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUJI5GZQ1WNoLfmSZiaBcAuMibAdO12EVNfohLJ687chn7tHpdXeuhWDEiaqcn4sibibIEbdod0xwqw805oby77WAgfgccJWOPlD1VE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2.TIDES业务与季度数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">TIDES业务（多肽与寡核苷酸）<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">75%</span>，而<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>增速仅为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>。这一增速跳升是全年指引上调的直接原因之一。管理层将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年TIDES收入增速预期从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40%</span>上调至45%，对应收入约165亿元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">订单数据提供了另一个观察维度。截至1H26末，公司在手订单<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">664亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>；<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>新签订单同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48%</span>。订单增速与收入增速的匹配关系表明，当前的增长并非一次性交付，而是有持续需求支撑。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">NOM在报告中提到，TIDES业务的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>与全球GLP-1受体激动剂相关需求有关。这一判断与公司此前披露的产能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>计划一致——管理层将全年资本开支计划从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">65亿</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">75亿元</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">75亿</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">85亿元</span>，同时将全年自由现金流目标从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">105亿</span>至115亿元上调至135亿至145亿元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWE7LkoUZiaEPEXKFFrd22pMYMxgpuJAeKhiaFfhzic6zMhXpLfrcLtVRgicqCWdibazYGds5RPQqI6PF7ttLibJuibcoyibpBShkpFicibI/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3.全年业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层将全年收入增速指引从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">39%</span>，对应收入区间<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">585亿</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">605亿元</span>。NOM此前预测为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">537亿元</span>，彭博一致预期为535亿元。新指引区间上限比市场预期高出约13%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">NOM将FY26F收入从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">537亿元</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">598亿元</span>，净利润从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">203亿元</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">235亿元</span>。对应每股收益8.15元，按8月3日收盘价计算的市盈率约为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.8倍</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUydF9u9tY2Txqma5lpNLibG8YG89g10Z59qdtI8HX8chSC0MZcrkwq8ibEXWlJiaib1iakTcH9DffWTj0vm1AL4JYCGYWWsaPdTSibY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 61-NOM-Wuxi Apptec-603259.SS-2Q26 results big beat and FY26E guidance significantly lifted-260803</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
